    "description": "Saylor Advertising.Inc. operates as an advertising company in Japan. The company offers media such as TV and radio commercial, newspaper, magazine, outdoor, and transportation advertising; marketing includes research and market surveys, target analysis and persona design, strategy planning, and customer journey design; and sales promotion comprises of camping planning and management, In-store promotion and POP production, sampling measures, and novelty item. It also provide digital services such as website, SNS marketing and operation support, SEO and content marketing, access analysis, data analysis, and MA implementation support, as well as listing, display, and social media advertising; public relations; and creative adverting includes graphic, video, web, copywriting and brand message development; CI/VI development and design system construction; package design; and content planning and production. In addition, the company includes retail and office space, showroom and exhibition booth, signage, sculptures, and display; brand consulting; business and product development; e-commerce, events, publications, regional revitalization, market and system development, digital transformation, and artificial intelligence. Further, it engages in the architecture/interior design supervision and construction management; and internet-related planning and management. Saylor Advertising.Inc. was incorporated in 1951 and is headquartered in Takamatsu, Japan."
